cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the accompanying article."
type: software
title: "sppbc: body composition from photon-counting CT by anatomy-guided material decomposition"
abstract: "Reference implementation of an anatomy-guided three-material decomposition (adipose tissue, base tissue, iodine) of contrast-enhanced photon-counting CT, and of its comparison with threshold-based body composition over identical voxels."
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimonHellbrueck/spectral-body-composition"
keywords:
  - "body composition"
  - "photon-counting CT"
  - "material decomposition"
  - "adipose tissue"
  - "spectral CT"
  - "deep learning segmentation"
